@api = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Lay danh sach bai tap - mong doi 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/assignments
Accept: application/json

### 2. Lay chi tiet bai tap 1 - mong doi 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/1
Accept: application/json

### 3. Bai tap khong ton tai - mong doi 404 ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/999
Accept: application/json

### 4. Tao luot nop cho bai tap 1 - mong doi 201 Created + Location
# @name createSubmission
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "DTC245200002",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/MINH282006/CNTTK23E"
}

### 5. Doc lai luot nop vua tao - mong doi 200 OK (gui request 4 truoc)
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}
Accept: application/json

### 6. Thieu ma sinh vien va kho ma nguon - mong doi 400 INVALID_SUBMISSION
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### 7. Nop bai tap da dong (bai 2) - mong doi 400 ASSIGNMENT_CLOSED
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/2/submissions
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "DTC245200002",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/MINH282006/CNTTK23E"
}
